From d0b4ddbb04ab2cfdb1728b1253b820ab477a81e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 23:02:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] TEACH-HIDEPT / TEACH-TABS / TEACH-UNWIRED-2 / TEACH-TYPED
 (web): Teach -- every control enumerated (1491): axes this machine does not
 have are hidden, the 5 tabs golden hides are hidden, every unwired button is
 greyed with its reason, typed values are always sent
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 1001: "teach 沒有enabel 的馬達 都隱藏掉", "一堆按鈕沒功能", "用枚舉 每個東西都檢查".

* TEACH-HIDEPT: a Set / Go button is hidden when every teach point it belongs to (JSON/teach-access.json)
  uses only axes that are missing from the C++ Mot_Table or Enable=0 (same rule as TEACH-HIDEAXIS; points
  without axes stay; nothing is hidden while the motor table comes from the static fallback). A value
  cell is hidden only when every point using it is hidden (save still reads it from the DOM). Group boxes
  left with no visible control are collapsed (shared teachCollapseHiddenGroups).
* TEACH-TABS: tsRotate / tsMagazine / tsOutSort / tsMR / tsShuttleSensor follow golden FormShow
  (JSON/View-rules.json: USE_ROTATE_KIT, AUTO3_IS_MAGAZINE, USE_OUT_SORT_ARM, USE_MR_SYSTEM,
  AUTO_SENSOR_INSTALL; onFalse hide).
* TEACH-UNWIRED-2: the buttons that were visible with no handler at all are greyed and a click says why
  (same mechanism as TEACH_UNWIRED). Z All Up / Z Servo are left out: they are being wired to golden.
* TEACH-TYPED: a cell the operator typed into (keypad commit fires input) is marked data-src=typed and
  sent with Set / Go -- golden GoButton020Click uteach.cpp:3597 atoi(EditPtr->Text). Before, a cell that
  C++ had not loaded (static) was never sent even after typing, and C++ refused the move.

Enumerated headless check (fake WS, GET-only server, nothing reaches wb_serve), all 1491 controls:
  buttons: hidden by axis 515, hidden by golden FormShow 79, visible+command 180, visible+greyed 67,
  select-axis 12, status 3, ui 5, no effect 6 (5 = Z All Up / Servo being wired, 1 = Motor Tools which
  posts to the frame host); tabs hidden by rule 10; fields visible 298 (keypad, readonly by design).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
